==German==
===Pronunciation===
*{{IPA|[ˈapfal]}}

===Etymology===
Compound of ''[[ab]]'' (‘from’) and ''[[Fall]]'' (‘fall’).

===Noun===
'''Abfall''' ''m'' (''pl'' [[Abfälle]])

# [[waste]], [[garbage]], [[rubbish]], [[litter]]
#* ''[[radioaktiv]]er'' '''Abfall'''''
#*: radioactive waste
# [[decrease]], [[decline]], [[drop]]
# {{context|lang=de|religion}} [[apostasy]]
#* '''''Abfall''' [[vom]] [[Glauben]]''
#*: apostasy from the creed

====Synonyms====
*''waste:'' [[Müll]]

====Derived terms====
*''waste:'' [[Abfallwirtschaft]], [[Abfalleimer]], [[Bauabfall]], [[Bioabfall]], [[Gartenabfall]]
*''decline:'' [[Druckabfall]] (decline of pressure)


